    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The hour and the times of day",
     "texto": [
      "The time is asked with **o której?**. To say «at…», the ordinal usually goes in the locative: **o siódmej**, **o ósmej**.",
      "For periods of time, expressions like **od… do…** («from… to…») are used. Days of the week are used without an article: **w poniedziałek** («on Monday»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
